### AI02 missing data: confirmed scenario has no offer for a required SKU
POST http://localhost:3000/planning/executions
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "forecastName": "Week-45",
  "scenarioName": "Confirmed-Scenario-Without-Flour-Offer",
  "referenceDate": "2026-11-05"
}

### Expected response shape (201)
{
  "requirements": [
    {
      "productSku": "PRD-FLOUR",
      "requiredUnits": 20,
      "replenishmentUnits": 20
    }
  ],
  "proposals": [],
  "unmetNeeds": [
    {
      "productSku": "PRD-FLOUR",
      "reason": "No supplier can fulfill 20"
    }
  ]
}
